WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:17,650
I read that fasting naturally increases HGH, which is human growth hormone in this article

00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:20,290
written by a functional medicine doctor.

00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:25,010
I know in your blog, it says not to take human growth hormone because it causes cancer

00:00:25,010 --> 00:00:28,370
to grow in alert ears with apoptosis.

00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:36,490
How is it that HCG, HGH, generated by fasting is good for cancer?

00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:41,690
Fasting also increases HGH, one just curious as to the difference.

00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:49,850
So, yes, fasting can increase all sorts of different growth factors.

00:00:49,850 --> 00:00:56,010
It does increase HGH, one production too, but typically only after you fast it.

00:00:56,010 --> 00:01:00,410
At least the studies that I've written is after you do a 24 hour fast.

00:01:00,410 --> 00:01:09,690
So, anything fasting less than 24 hours, typically we tell people is perfectly fine for cancer patients.

00:01:09,690 --> 00:01:17,290
If you're fasting more than 24 hours, you do risk raising your HGH, one levels and other growth

00:01:17,290 --> 00:01:22,330
hormones as well. That's part of the benefit of fasting if you don't have cancer.

00:01:22,330 --> 00:01:26,810
So, if you don't have cancer and you're going on and you've done some fasting,

00:01:26,890 --> 00:01:32,010
you never say to go, oh, that's three day faster, seven day faster, 10 day faster, longer than that.

00:01:32,010 --> 00:01:35,530
If you've never fasted at all, fasting is something you need to work into.

00:01:36,970 --> 00:01:46,250
But we have had cancer patients that have done a 21 day fast or a 10 day fast prior to

00:01:46,250 --> 00:01:51,210
starting with us or even after starting with us and they seem to do real well.

00:01:51,290 --> 00:01:57,370
So, there's the card evidence that's out there is that after 24 hours of fasting,

00:01:57,370 --> 00:02:02,010
you do raise human growth hormone levels and IGF-1 levels.

00:02:02,810 --> 00:02:09,130
Therefore, we tend to tell people that you should limit your fast to less than 24 hours.

00:02:10,650 --> 00:02:13,930
That's typically an advice on fasting.

